*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0035
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-01-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 370
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0035.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0035C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 CREDIT-REFERRED VALUE 'R'.
    05 DECLINE-RSN        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2500-BK-RULES
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    DISPLAY "DECLINE-RSN=" DECLINE-RSN
    STOP RUN.
2500-BK-RULES.
    IF BANKRUPTCY-BANKRUPT
        IF YRS-SINCE-BK < 5
            MOVE 'D' TO CREDIT-DECN
            MOVE 'BK1' TO DECLINE-RSN
        ELSE
            SET CREDIT-REFERRED TO TRUE
            MOVE 'BK2' TO DECLINE-RSN
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'NA' TO DECLINE-RSN
    END-IF.
